sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability to inoperative

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Inoperative, evse.id = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: ChangeAvailabilityRequest<br>- operationalStatus Inoperative<br>- evse.id <Configured evseId><br>- connectorId omit
    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Scheduled)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Wait for <Configured Transaction Duration>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State StopAuthorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPostSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    loop For all connectors
        alt StatusNotification
            CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable, evseId = <Configured evseId>)
            CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        else NotifyEvent
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Unavailable", component.name = "Connector", component.evse.id = <Configured evseId>, variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end

    Note over CSMS: Post scenario validation: A respond to report the state of a connector<br>has been received for all connectors.
